{"seq":3,"slug":"lastmile-cs-tracking-link","title":"尾程轨迹与客服联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-lastmile-delivery-network/lastmile-quality-ops/lastmile-cs-tracking-link","wordCount":2175,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"尾程轨迹与客服联动\">尾程轨迹与客服联动</h1><p>买家打开物流页看到&quot;派送中&quot;，三小时后还是&quot;派送中&quot;，一天后依然是&quot;派送中&quot;——这时他会做什么？如果系统什么都不做，他会来找客服。而此时客服看到的是同一条&quot;派送中&quot;，既说不出包裹在哪，也给不出新的时间，只能回复&quot;请您耐心等待&quot;。这就是尾程体验最典型的崩坏场景：<strong>数据本来在那里，但没有人把它转化成动作</strong>。这一篇讲轨迹数据如何驱动主动服务，以及客服侧需要什么样的信息视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-轨迹事件到动作的映射\">核心概念：轨迹事件到动作的映射</h2><p>轨迹的价值不在于展示，而在于<strong>触发</strong>。同一条事件对不同角色意味着不同的动作，而这个映射关系应该被显式定义，不能靠客服凭经验判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件到动作的映射表\">事件到动作的映射表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轨迹事件</th>\n<th>买家侧动作</th>\n<th>客服侧动作</th>\n<th>系统侧动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>到达目的国分拨中心</td>\n<td>更新预计时效</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>启动尾程时效计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送失败</td>\n<td>推送改址/改约入口</td>\n<td>创建待跟进工单</td>\n<td>启动退回前干预倒计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转自提点</td>\n<td>推送取件码与位置</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>启动保管期计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保管期过半未取</td>\n<td>催取提醒</td>\n<td>视客单价决定是否外呼</td>\n<td>标记逾期风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超过承诺时效无更新</td>\n<td>主动告知新预期</td>\n<td>主动联系 + 补偿评估</td>\n<td>触发违约补偿规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>妥投</td>\n<td>邀请评价</td>\n<td>关闭关联工单</td>\n<td>结算尾程时长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最值得展开的是&quot;超过承诺时效无更新&quot;。它是<strong>静默延误</strong>——包裹没有失败、没有退回、也没有任何异常事件，只是停止更新了。承运商侧可能什么都没发生（系统未回传事件），也可能包裹已经卡在某个环节。对买家而言，静默延误比明确的失败更焦虑，因为没有信息就意味着无法预期。</p>\n<p>处理静默延误的正确方式是<strong>基于时间阈值而非事件触发</strong>：为每个订单维护&quot;距上次事件更新的时长&quot;，超过阈值（按承运商与目的的国分别设定）就生成一条待处理任务。这需要轨迹系统提供&quot;最后事件时间&quot;这个字段，而不只是事件列表。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[轨迹事件流] --&gt; B[状态归一化]&#10;  B --&gt; C{事件类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|失败/异常| D[高优先级任务&lt;br/&gt;客服立即介入]&#10;  C --&gt;|正常节点| E[更新展示]&#10;  E --&gt; F{距上次更新&lt;br/&gt;超过阈值?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[静默延误任务]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| E&#10;  D --&gt; H[客服工作台]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{可自动解决?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[自动推送/补偿]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[人工坐席]&#10;  J --&gt; L[结果回写]&#10;  K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[轨迹事件流] --&gt; B[状态归一化]\n  B --&gt; C{事件类型}\n  C --&gt;|失败/异常| D[高优先级任务&lt;br/&gt;客服立即介入]\n  C --&gt;|正常节点| E[更新展示]\n  E --&gt; F{距上次更新&lt;br/&gt;超过阈值?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[静默延误任务]\n  F --&gt;|否| E\n  D --&gt; H[客服工作台]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{可自动解决?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[自动推送/补偿]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[人工坐席]\n  J --&gt; L[结果回写]\n  K --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"客服工作台需要什么\">客服工作台需要什么</h2><p>客服在处理物流问题时，最怕的不是问题复杂，而是<strong>信息分散</strong>。一个典型的低效场景是：坐席需要打开承运商官网查轨迹、打开订单系统查地址、打开工单系统写记录，来回切换中买家已经在对话窗口里等了五分钟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按-能做什么-组织视图\">按&quot;能做什么&quot;组织视图</h3><p>高效的工作台应该把决策所需的信息压缩到一个视图里，并且按&quot;现在能做什么&quot;组织，而不是按&quot;发生了什么&quot;组织。</p>\n<p>这个设计原则有制度层面的支撑。邮政体系的公开规则说明，收件人未能收到投递时，&quot;邮局会向收件人提供一份通知&quot;，收件人随后需要&quot;取件或申请再投&quot;，若在期限内既未取件也未申请再投则退回发件人（<a href=\"https://pe.usps.com/text/dmm300/508.htm\">USPS DMM 508 收件人服务</a>）。这段规则的工程含义是：<strong>通知与可执行动作必须成对出现</strong>——只有状态告知而没有下一步动作的通知，等于把决策负担全部转给收件人。客服工作台的设计遵循同一逻辑：显示&quot;派送失败&quot;是不够的，必须同时显示&quot;可改址/可改约/可转自提&quot;以及各自的成本。核心字段包括：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;csOrderView&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;trackingNo&quot;: &quot;LX123456789DE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;carrier&quot;: &quot;commercial-express&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lastmileState&quot;: &quot;delivery_failed_notified&quot;,&#10;    &quot;promisedDeliveryBy&quot;: &quot;2026-10-03T18:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;hoursUntilIrreversible&quot;: 31,&#10;    &quot;lastEventAt&quot;: &quot;2026-10-02T09:12:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;hoursSinceLastEvent&quot;: 26,&#10;    &quot;availableActions&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;address_change&quot;, &quot;costEur&quot;: 6.5, &quot;selfServiceUrl&quot;: &quot;...&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;redirect_pickup&quot;, &quot;nearestPointM&quot;: 420, &quot;costEur&quot;: 3.2 },&#10;      { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;reschedule&quot;, &quot;costEur&quot;: 0 }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;buyerContext&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;priorDisputes&quot;: 0,&#10;      &quot;orderValueEur&quot;: 189,&#10;      &quot;preferredChannel&quot;: &quot;push&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;recommendedAction&quot;: &quot;redirect_pickup&quot;,&#10;    &quot;compensationEligible&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"csOrderView\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"trackingNo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LX123456789DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"carrier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"commercial-express\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lastmileState\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"delivery_failed_notified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"promisedDeliveryBy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-03T18:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hoursUntilIrreversible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lastEventAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-02T09:12:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hoursSinceLastEvent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">26</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"availableActions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"address_change\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"costEur\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"selfServiceUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redirect_pickup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"nearestPointM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">420</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"costEur\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reschedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"costEur\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"buyerContext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priorDisputes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"orderValueEur\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">189</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"preferredChannel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"push\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"recommendedAction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redirect_pickup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"compensationEligible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>hoursUntilIrreversible</code> 与 <code>availableActions</code> 是整个视图的核心——它们把&quot;发生了什么&quot;翻译成&quot;还剩多少时间、现在能做什么、成本多少&quot;。<code>recommendedAction</code> 则由规则引擎给出建议，坐席可以采纳或覆盖。这个设计的目标是把一次物流咨询从&quot;查资料再判断&quot;压缩成&quot;确认或调整建议&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"坐席权限与自动化边界\">坐席权限与自动化边界</h3><p>不是所有动作都适合让坐席直接执行。<strong>零成本、可逆的动作</strong>（改约时段、推送取件提醒）可以开放给坐席一键执行。<strong>有成本的动作</strong>（改址、转自提）通常需要买家确认费用，应由坐席发起、买家确认。<strong>涉及资金的动作</strong>（退款、赔偿）应按金额分级授权，超过阈值的需上级审批。</p>\n<p>把这个边界定义清楚，比给坐席开放所有权限更有效——因为无边界权限会导致坐席为了避免麻烦而回避使用工具，系统再强大也没人用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动服务-在投诉之前介入\">主动服务：在投诉之前介入</h2><p>被动等买家来问，是尾程客服成本最高的模式。主动服务的目标是在买家产生负面情绪<strong>之前</strong>介入，而介入的时机与方式由轨迹数据决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四条高价值触发规则\">四条高价值触发规则</h3><p>主动服务的触发条件应该收敛到少数几条高价值规则，而不是对所有异常都发消息（过度打扰同样是伤害）：</p>\n<p><strong>第一条是静默延误超阈值</strong>。当包裹超过承诺时效且无新事件时，主动告知&quot;我们注意到您的包裹更新延迟，新的预计时间是 X，如再有延迟我们将主动补偿&quot;。这条消息的价值在于它把&quot;买家发现异常&quot;变成&quot;卖家主动承认异常&quot;，信任损失小得多。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条是派送失败后</strong>。失败通知不应只是&quot;投递不成功&quot;，而应同时给出可执行的下一步（改址入口、附近自提点、重新预约）。这类通知的转化率远高于单纯的状态告知。</p>\n<p><strong>第三条是自提逾期预警</strong>。这是唯一能在退回前挽回的机会，必须主动触达（详见<a href=\"../pickup-locker-multi/pickup-notification-hold\">到柜通知与保管规则</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第四条是妥投后的异常反馈</strong>。当轨迹显示妥投但买家随后在平台内表达&quot;没收到&quot;时，应立即创建高优先级工单而不是等买家走完投诉流程——因为这类争议的处理窗口（尤其是 POD 证据的可用性）是有时效的，见<a href=\"../delivery-fail-retry/proof-of-delivery-dispute\">签收证明与妥投争议</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 主动服务候选队列：静默延误 + 失败未跟进 + 自提逾期风险&#10;SELECT&#10;  f.order_id,&#10;  f.tracking_no,&#10;  f.carrier,&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN f.lastmile_state = &#39;delivery_failed_notified&#39;&#10;         AND f.followed_up_at IS NULL THEN &#39;failed_not_followed_up&#39;&#10;    WHEN f.hours_since_last_event &gt; c.silence_threshold_hours&#10;         AND f.final_delivered = FALSE THEN &#39;silent_delay&#39;&#10;    WHEN f.lastmile_state = &#39;at_pickup_point&#39;&#10;         AND f.hold_expires_at &lt; NOW() + INTERVAL &#39;48 hours&#39; THEN &#39;pickup_expiry_risk&#39;&#10;  END AS trigger_type,&#10;  f.hours_until_irreversible,&#10;  f.order_value_eur,&#10;  RANK() OVER (&#10;    PARTITION BY f.carrier&#10;    ORDER BY f.order_value_eur DESC, f.hours_until_irreversible ASC&#10;  ) AS priority&#10;FROM order_lastmile_fact f&#10;JOIN carrier_config c ON c.carrier = f.carrier&#10;WHERE f.final_delivered = FALSE&#10;  AND (&#10;    (f.lastmile_state = &#39;delivery_failed_notified&#39; AND f.followed_up_at IS NULL)&#10;    OR f.hours_since_last_event &gt; c.silence_threshold_hours&#10;    OR (f.lastmile_state = &#39;at_pickup_point&#39;&#10;        AND f.hold_expires_at &lt; NOW() + INTERVAL &#39;48 hours&#39;)&#10;  )&#10;ORDER BY priority&#10;LIMIT 200;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主动服务候选队列：静默延误 + 失败未跟进 + 自提逾期风险</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tracking_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lastmile_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivery_failed_notified'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">followed_up_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed_not_followed_up'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours_since_last_event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">silence_threshold_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">final_delivered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silent_delay'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lastmile_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'at_pickup_point'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hold_expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pickup_expiry_risk'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours_until_irreversible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_value_eur</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_value_eur</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours_until_irreversible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ASC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_lastmile_fact f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_config c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">final_delivered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lastmile_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivery_failed_notified'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">followed_up_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hours_since_last_event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">silence_threshold_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lastmile_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'at_pickup_point'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hold_expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询的排序策略值得说明：按<strong>客单价降序 + 剩余时间升序</strong>排序。高价值且时间紧迫的订单优先，因为它们的处理收益最高、失败成本最大。这个排序不是歧视低价值订单，而是资源有限时的理性分配——低价值订单由自动化规则覆盖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主动服务的成本上限\">主动服务的成本上限</h3><p>主动服务不是越主动越好。每次主动触达都有成本（消息费用、可能引发的补偿、以及买家被打扰的负面感受）。因此需要设定<strong>主动触达预算</strong>：按订单价值分档，低价值订单只触发自动化补偿（如优惠券），高价值订单才投入人工坐席。这个预算规则必须显式配置，否则主动服务会演变成对所有订单的无差别跟进，成本失控而收益递减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>轨迹的价值在<strong>触发动作</strong>而非展示；同一条事件对买家、客服、系统三方的动作映射应显式定义。</li>\n<li>静默延误（无失败无异常但停止更新）需要基于<strong>时间阈值</strong>而非事件来检测，因为它没有事件可触发；需要轨迹系统提供&quot;最后事件时间&quot;字段。</li>\n<li>客服工作台应按&quot;现在能做什么&quot;组织：核心是剩余不可逆时间、可用动作与成本、推荐动作与买家上下文，把物流咨询从&quot;查资料再判断&quot;压缩成&quot;确认或调整建议&quot;。</li>\n<li>坐席权限按动作性质分级：零成本可逆动作一键执行，有成本动作需买家确认，涉及资金按金额分级授权——无边界权限会导致工具被回避。</li>\n<li>主动服务收敛到四条高价值规则（静默延误、派送失败、自提逾期预警、妥投后异常反馈）；必须设定按订单价值分档的触达预算，避免无差别跟进。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：客服联动的成本输入与指标口径见<a href=\"delivery-success-sla\">妥投率与尾程时效 SLA</a>；派送失败后的干预窗口见<a href=\"../delivery-fail-retry/address-correction-reroute\">改址/重派与退回前干预</a>；自提逾期预警的完整规则见<a href=\"../pickup-locker-multi/pickup-notification-hold\">到柜通知与保管规则</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"尾程轨迹与客服联动","id":"尾程轨迹与客服联动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：轨迹事件到动作的映射","id":"核心概念-轨迹事件到动作的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"事件到动作的映射表","id":"事件到动作的映射表"},{"level":2,"text":"客服工作台需要什么","id":"客服工作台需要什么"},{"level":3,"text":"按\"能做什么\"组织视图","id":"按-能做什么-组织视图"},{"level":3,"text":"坐席权限与自动化边界","id":"坐席权限与自动化边界"},{"level":2,"text":"主动服务：在投诉之前介入","id":"主动服务-在投诉之前介入"},{"level":3,"text":"四条高价值触发规则","id":"四条高价值触发规则"},{"level":3,"text":"主动服务的成本上限","id":"主动服务的成本上限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预约派送与时段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-lastmile-delivery-network/lastmile-quality-ops/scheduled-delivery-slot"},"next":null}